</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c3672ef2-9814-11f1-b29d-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26226673780195.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c3672ef2-9814-11f1-b29d-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26226673780195.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">e0956b10-9814-11f1-907a-3d0892f46077</guid><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 19:19:49 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c3672ef2-9814-11f1-b29d-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26226673780195.jpg">AP Photo/Jon Elswick - Jon Elswick</source><dc:creator>左依</dc:creator></item><item><category>政治</category><title>印度将与英国企业合作开发“印度国产”战斗机发动机，推进军工自主化</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB/20260814-%E5%8D%B0%E5%BA%A6%E5%B0%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%8B%B1%E5%9B%BD%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E5%90%88%E4%BD%9C%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91-%E5%8D%B0%E5%BA%A6%E5%9B%BD%E4%BA%A7-%E6%88%98%E6%96%97%E6%9C%BA%E5%8F%91%E5%8A%A8%E6%9C%BA%EF%BC%8C%E6%8E%A8%E8%BF%9B%E5%86%9B%E5%B7%A5%E8%87%AA%E4%B8%BB%E5%8C%96</link><description>
